  "sourceOfTruthNotes": "Canonical learner content is workspace/index.html, course-data.json, main.js, state-store.js, styles.css, unit-d.css and workspace assets. course-data.js is compiled from course-data.json. Original eight-lesson content is frozen in meta/previous-draft-catalog.json and loaded read-only through legacy-v1-data.js from its separate saved-work namespace. Static lesson text has durable edit keys; runtime practice and saved-work surfaces are Annotation only. Original Brightspace ZIP is immutable. Question-level Textbook Practice crops, its browser overlay and its review manifest regenerate from the canonical textbook/page catalog with scripts/build-science24-textbook-practice.py. The overlay freezes the earlier page catalog as legacyBookQuestions so original saved page records remain visible and are never counted as replacement question work. The mobile motion-graph image is a stacked responsive rendering of the same canonical source panels used on desktop. Candidate stays blocked; Studio Edit/export disabled.",
